STEVE: CLAUDIA MADE A FRANTIC

00:00:39.817 --> 00:00:41.975
CALL TO 911 FOR HELP.
BUT HER PHONE DIED BEFORE SHE

00:00:42.010 --> 00:00:45.412
BUT HER PHONE DIED BEFORE SHE

00:00:45.423 --> 00:00:49.964
COULD SEND THE LOCATION.

00:00:49.975 --> 00:00:52.974
YOU KNOW WHAT IT’S LIKE OUT

00:00:52.985 --> 00:00:55.339
THERE WHEN IT’S HOT LIKE THAT.

00:00:55.372 --> 00:00:56.296
&gt;&gt; THIS STORY HURTS.

00:00:56.298 --> 00:00:59.390
ANY BORDER PATROL AGENT THAT HAS

00:00:59.391 --> 00:01:01.805
