00:01:01.807 --> 00:01:03.001
UNDERSTAND THAT WITHOUT PROPER

00:01:03.002 --> 00:01:04.499
POLICY AND PROGRAMS IN PLACE WE

00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:06.672
CAN’T JUST REACH THESE

00:01:06.673 --> 00:01:08.896
INDIVIDUALS IN TIME TO KNOW THIS

00:01:08.907 --> 00:01:11.198
TRAGEDY WAS PREVENTABLE, TO KNOW

00:01:11.232 --> 00:01:14.218
THAT HAD WE HAD THE PROPER

00:01:14.229 --> 00:01:15.651
