00:01:19.504 --> 00:01:21.547
WE HAVE HAD AGENTS THAT HAVE

00:01:21.558 --> 00:01:23.038
DIED, PUT THEIR LIVES ON THE

00:01:23.049 --> 00:01:24.162
LINE TO GO IN TO SAVE THESE

00:01:24.173 --> 00:01:24.425
PEOPLE.

00:01:24.459 --> 00:01:26.620
THAT’S WHAT WE WANT TO DO.

00:01:26.621 --> 00:01:29.488
TO KNOW THIS WAS PREVENTABLE,

00:01:29.499 --> 00:01:31.338
REALLY UPSETS US AND IT HURTS

00:01:31.349 --> 00:01:33.912
KNOWING THAT WE HAVE HAD TO SEE

00:01:33.914 --> 00:01:35.725
THIS OVER AND OVER AGAIN.

