00:02:00.982 --> 00:02:01.935
&gt;&gt; YEAH.

00:02:01.946 --> 00:02:03.670
WE HAVE COMPLETE AND TOTAL CHAOS

00:02:03.681 --> 00:02:04.754
ON OUR SOUTHWEST BORDER.

00:02:04.788 --> 00:02:06.182
WE DON’T KNOW WHO IS COME IN.

00:02:06.193 --> 00:02:07.484
WE DON’T KNOW WHERE THEY ARE

00:02:07.517 --> 00:02:08.575
COME FRFMENT WE DON’T KNOW WHAT

00:02:08.586 --> 00:02:09.474
THEIR INTENTIONS ARE IN THE

00:02:09.485 --> 00:02:09.940
UNITED STATES.

00:02:09.951 --> 00:02:12.163
YET, IS HE WILLING TO GO AND

00:02:12.174 --> 00:02:13.189
SECURE A BORDER OF ANOTHER

00:02:13.200 --> 00:02:13.714
COUNTRY.

00:02:13.748 --> 00:02:15.147
HIS RESPONSIBILITY IS TO HIS

00:02:15.158 --> 00:02:16.844
CITIZENS, TO ALL THE PEOPLE THAT

00:02:16.877 --> 00:02:18.051
