00:02:18.053 --> 00:02:19.073
ILLEGALLY TO EVERYBODY THAT’S

00:02:19.084 --> 00:02:19.953
CURRENTLY HERE.

00:02:19.964 --> 00:02:21.209
THAT’S WHERE HIS RESPONSIBILITY

00:02:21.220 --> 00:02:21.526
IS.

00:02:21.537 --> 00:02:23.582
YET, IS HE FAILING IN THAT AND

00:02:23.593 --> 00:02:25.141
HE IS FAILING MISERABLY.

00:02:25.152 --> 00:02:27.496
WHEN WE LOOK AT THE THREAT THAT

00:02:27.507 --> 00:02:29.396
WE FACE ON A DAILY BASIS, AND

00:02:29.407 --> 00:02:31.104
THE PROTECTION OF CITIZENS OF

00:02:31.138 --> 00:02:32.677
THIS COUNTRY, WHERE IS HE?

00:02:32.678 --> 00:02:35.187
AND IS HE NOWHERE TO BE FOUND

00:02:35.198 --> 00:02:36.918
AND, YES, IT IS VERY IRONIC THAT

00:02:36.929 --> 00:02:38.366
HE IS WILLING TO GO AND SECURE

00:02:38.377 --> 00:02:39.515
THE BORDER OF ANOTHER COUNTRY

00:02:39.526 --> 00:02:41.699
BUT HE IS NOT WILLING TO SECURE

00:02:41.733 --> 00:02:42.921
OUR OWN BORDERS FOR OUR OWN

00:02:42.932 --> 00:02:43.156
CITIZENS.

